## Rules

{{safety}}
- Read `POSTDELEGATE_API_KEY` from the environment. Never commit it or put it in front-end code.
- Errors: `401` is a bad or rotated key (REST takes no `Bearer `). `400` is validation, so fix the named field. `402` is a plan limit. `429` is the hourly post limit.
